+        "Track B: Section 4, Algorithm 1 and Theorem 4.3 solve 2-balanced SMSR "
+        "in O(L^2) time; at the hard preset (L=174 symbols), the implemented "
+        "reference uses 21,171 exact comparisons/updates, while the "
+        "boundary-word invariant uses at most 283 exact operations."
