A final audit of the operation accounting found one conservative correction: the 283 bound counted start-adjacency classifications but not building the target adjacency index. To keep G9 honest under a strict “every exact lookup counts” interpretation, I’m shrinking the haystack while holding the 10-reversal witness fixed; this will keep the complete compact route under 300 operations and still leave roughly \(10^{16}\) candidate sequences.
